        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "8cefbb66-0939-5483-966b-0b956b10e330",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dane DeHaan, Dennis Stock, James Dean, Robert Pattinson, Derek Cianfrance, Anton Corbijn, Gore Verbinski, Luc Besson\n- Works: In Treatment, Chronicle, The Place Beyond the Pines, Kill Your Darlings, The Amazing Spider-Man 2, Life, A Cure for Wellness, Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets\n- Roles: Jesse, Andrew Detmer, Jason Kancam, Lucien Carr, Harry Osborn, Lockhart\n\nFacts:\n- Dane DeHaan played Jesse on the HBO series \"In Treatment.\"\n- In 2012, Dane DeHaan played Andrew Detmer in \"Chronicle.\"\n- In 2012, Dane DeHaan played Jason Kancam in Derek Cianfrance's \"The Place Beyond the Pines.\"\n- In 2013, Dane DeHaan played Lucien Carr in \"Kill Your Darlings.\"\n- In 2014, Dane DeHaan played Harry Osborn in \"The Amazing Spider-Man 2.\"\n- In 2015, Anton Corbijn's \"Life\" was based on the friendship between \"Life\" photographer Dennis Stock and actor James Dean.\n- In 2015, \"Life\" starred Robert Pattinson as Dennis Stock and Dane DeHaan as James Dean.\n- In 2016, Dane DeHaan played Lockhart in Gore Verbinski's \"A Cure for Wellness.\"\n- In 2017, Dane DeHaan played the title character in Luc Besson's \"Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
